# Tiki Taka - Cursor Rules

## Architecture
- `apps/desktop/`: Browser interface, DOM views (#home-view, #arena-view), controls, CSS.
- `packages/engine/`: Pure headless simulation, mechanics, scoring, tactics, progress.
  - RULE: ZERO DOM/browser globals (`window`, `document`, `localStorage`, `AudioContext`).
- `packages/presentation/`: Canvas 2D renderer and Web Audio sound synthesis.
- `packages/data/`: Data persistence (local storage guest adapter + optional Supabase adapter).
- `src/`: Compatibility re-exports for engine/presentation. Keep exports intact.

## Key Commands
- Run unit tests: `npm test`
- Build production bundle: `npm run build`
- Run dev server: `npm start`
- Run desktop browser tests: `npm run test:web` (or single: `npm run test:interface`, `npm run test:one-touch`)

## Guidelines
- Vanilla JavaScript (ES Modules), Canvas 2D, Web Audio. No heavy framework dependencies.
- 2 spaces indentation, LF line endings.
- Keep simulation deterministic (seeded PRNG).
- Never commit `dist/`, `test-results/`, `.tooling/`, or `.env`.
